# macOS custom folder icon. Zero bytes on disk; the icon itself lives in the
# resource fork, so it is ignored rather than deleted. The name really does end
# in a carriage return, and git strips one trailing CR when it parses this
# file, so the line below carries two. With one it silently matches nothing.
Icon

# Supabase CLI scratch (version cache, linked-project state)
supabase/.temp/
